# Copy

User-facing text lives in `messages/`, not in React files. Full guide: `COPY.md`.

- Locales: `lt` (default), `en`. Edit both. Keep keys identical.
- Shared chrome → `messages/{locale}.json`
- Home → `messages/{locale}/home.json`
- Original PDP → `messages/{locale}/product-original.json`
- Reviews → `messages/{locale}/reviews-page.json`
- Do not rename keys. Do not change `id`, `href`, `image`, `src`, `left`, `top`, `width`, `className`, `offset`, or prices.
- Keep `{amount}`, `{price}`, `{count}`, `{name}`, `{title}` placeholders as-is.
- Brand is **Asleep**, not Matt. After edits run `bun run i18n:check`.
